<title>BRAZIL: Soy shipping conditions at Brazil's Santos port.</title>
<headline>Soy shipping conditions at Brazil's Santos port.</headline>
<dateline>SAO PAULO 1997-03-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Santos port reported the following conditions for shipments of soybeans and soymeal Monday:</p>
<p>Vessels: Flag Nikolas due to complete loading of 43,530 tonnes soymeal, scheduled to leave at 1500 local/1800 GMT. Thomas Future, arrived March 7, waiting for cargo and expected to dock from March 12 to load 50,000 tonnes soybeans.</p>
<p>Trucks: 146 arrived Sunday and unloaded 3,377 tonnes soybeans, 333 tonnes of soymeal.</p>
<p>Stocks: 63,471 tonnes soybeans, 5,435 tonnes soymeal.</p>
<p>((--Joelle Diderich, Sao Paulo newsroom +55 11 248 5417))</p>
